\pard\s0\fs8\sa60\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 Use one FastAPI application with modules owned by different members. Separate ownership does not require separate servers. Member 1 can mount a verified webhook router in your app, and Member 2 can expose functions or a router within the same backend.\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 You coordinate the handoffs. Member 1 remains responsible for PayPal protocol details; Member 2 remains responsible for the extraction model and prompts. You remain responsible for validating their outputs at your boundary and for the decisions your service records.\par
