\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 Supported intent values are ADDRESS_CHANGE_REQUEST, DELIVERY_QUESTION, THANKS, OTHER and AMBIGUOUS. The quote must be a nonempty exact substring of the original message. This confirms the quoted text came from that message; it does not independently prove the intent interpretation is correct.\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 Analysis may be absent initially. The same message ID and unchanged text may receive analysis later. Reusing an existing ID with conflicting data produces a conflict instead of overwriting history silently.\par
\pard\s3\f0\fs24\b\sb180\sa100\keepn Parsed label from Member 2\b0\par
\pard\s0\f1\fs18\li120\sa0\sl220\slmult0\keep\keepn \{\par
