\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 POST /labels accepts this parsed JSON. It does not accept an image file. Member 2 must implement upload and vision parsing or an adapter that feeds this contract. Missing label confidence routes to REVIEW.\par
\pard\s3\f0\fs24\b\sb180\sa100\keepn Reading the response\b0\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 An OrderView includes capture information, state, timestamps, latest message, latest analysis, latest label, comparison, verdict and recommended_action. Before a label is evaluated, verdict and recommended_action are null; comparison.match is also null. Null means no complete result yet, not a green result.\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 The same response shape is returned by queue, detail, message and label routes. Member 4 can update the drawer directly from a successful message or label response, then refresh the queue as needed.\par
\pard\s2\f0\fs30\b\sb260\sa130\keepn 9 The address engine from input to verdict\b0\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 The public entry point in app/rules.py is evaluate(inputs). It reads the PayPal address, the label address, optional intent analysis and seller-protection status. It returns comparison, verdict and recommended action without writing to the database.\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 normalize(address) first validates the address shape. It requires line1, city, state and postal code to contain text. It accepts known two-letter state or territory codes and either a five-digit ZIP or ZIP plus four extension. It then parses the street and unit through usaddress.\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 The supported parser result must be a Street Address with a house number and street name. Unsupported parsed components, repeated labels and incomplete unit information produce an uncertain result. PO boxes are currently routed to REVIEW instead of being supported automatically.\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 The code canonicalizes common suffixes such as Street and St, and direction words such as North and N. It compares house number, assembled street, unit identifier, city, state and full postal code. Country is fixed to US by the schema.\par
\pard\s3\f0\fs24\b\sb180\sa100\keepn Match describes the comparison facts\b0\par
