\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 A MISMATCH with REVIEW is not a contradiction. The comparison records the difference, while the verdict says human checking is required because another condition is uncertain. Preserve the reasons for both.\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 The current comparison does not use the proposed message address as an independent destination check. An unrecognized or untranslated customer request can therefore require additional workflow design. Document this limitation in integration discussions instead of describing the prototype as a complete fraud detector.\par
\pard\s0\f0\fs22\keep\sa120\sl270\slmult0 Before changing suffix mappings, numeric cutoffs, missing-unit behavior or precedence, add representative test cases, agree on the intended result and bump the rule version when the policy changes. Keep the original inputs in the audit snapshot.\par
